howl-report 2
profile el
verdict inconclusive
termination fixpoint
rounds 1
inconsistent false
omitted 6
omission DifferentIndividuals(http://example.org/t#a http://example.org/t#c)
omission NegativeAssertion(_:b0 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NegativePropertyAssertion> .)
omission ReservedVocabulary(_:b0 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#assertionProperty> <http://example.org/t#r> .)
omission ReservedVocabulary(_:b0 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sourceIndividual> <http://example.org/t#a> .)
omission ReservedVocabulary(_:b0 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#targetIndividual> <http://example.org/t#c> .)
omission SameIndividual(http://example.org/t#a http://example.org/t#b)
unsatisfiable 0
subsumptions 1
sub http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
exit 2
